GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 1 r 3(1) a person is a claimant` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF role EQUALS Claimant OR `the person is in the position of a claimant in a counterclaim` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "“claimant” includes a party in the position of a claimant in a counterclaim"

-- src:96 | “counterclaim” has the same meaning as “statement of claim”;
